-- title:
--   Original infinite-cap bounded-prefix positive-clock masked physical Ito-Meyer expected budget
-- statement:
--   At each original right-continuous prefix-bounded stopping clock, the exact discounted post-right value and closed-Iic dividend cash has expected upper bound when its zero-clock event is replaced by the initial value. Integrability of the masked reward is part of the assertion. This isolates the genuinely positive-time Ito-Meyer, compensated-jump, Gaussian and dividend/ruin accounting; the zero-clock inequality and transfer back to the original reward are separately Proved.
